# Sylvan Scrying finds and reveals a land from its controller's library, puts it in that player's hand, then shuffles (CR 701.19a, 701.23a).

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Sylvan Scrying
Island x4
Grizzly Bears
Mountain
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Island x7
Mountain
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sylvan Scrying.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
! Bot1.Search(Grizzly Bears)
! Bot1.Search(Mountain; Island)
Bot1.Search(Mountain)

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Mountain; Island; Island; Island; Island
Bot1.Shuffles = 1
Bot1.Revealed = Mountain
Bot2.Shuffles = 0
Bot2.Hand = Mountain; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island
